                    <span id="lblSpecialRequirementText"><div><p style="text-align: left; margin: 6pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"><span style="color: #0000ff;">Virtual interviews via web portals or phone may be offered as deemed appropriate and feasible.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #0000ff;"> </span></span><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"><span style="color: #0000ff;"><br />Finance operates under a hybrid telework model, which requires employees to work in the office (report to headquarters) for a minimum of two days during the workweek. The hybrid policy is subject to change, and additional in-office days may be required at management&#39;s discretion.</span></span></span></p></div></span>
